{
  "id": "27862_boukou",
  "headword": "{暴行|ぼうこう}",
  "reading": "ぼうこう",
  "romaji": "boukou",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "assault; act of violence; battery",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "assault; act of violence; (legally) battery",
      "explanation": "The use of physical violence against another person. In legal contexts it refers to the crime of using force on someone, and it is sometimes a euphemism for sexual assault."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27862_boukou_ex1",
      "japanese": "{暴行|ぼうこう}を{受|う}ける。",
      "english": "to be assaulted.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27862_boukou_ex2",
      "japanese": "{男|おとこ}は{通行人|つうこうにん}に{暴行|ぼうこう}を{加|くわ}えた。",
      "english": "The man assaulted a passerby.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27862_boukou_ex3",
      "japanese": "{容疑者|ようぎしゃ}は{口論|こうろん}の{末|すえ}に{相手|あいて}に{暴行|ぼうこう}し、{警察|けいさつ}に{逮捕|たいほ}された。",
      "english": "The suspect assaulted the other person after an argument and was arrested by the police.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Refers to inflicting physical violence on a person. Common in news and legal contexts, and sometimes used as a euphemism for sexual assault.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {暴行|ぼうこう}を{加|くわ}える: to commit an assault (on someone)\n- {暴行|ぼうこう}を{受|う}ける: to be assaulted\n- {暴行|ぼうこう}{事件|じけん}: an assault case\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {暴力|ぼうりょく}: violence — the general phenomenon of force, whereas {暴行|ぼうこう} is a specific violent act\n- {傷害|しょうがい}: bodily injury (as a crime) — an assault that actually causes injury",
